gle Tag Manager (noscript) --></div><div class=\"navbar-no-shadow\"><div data-animation=\"default\" data-collapse=\"small\" data-duration=\"400\" data-easing=\"ease\" data-easing2=\"ease\" role=\"banner\" class=\"navbar-no-shadow-container w-nav\"><div class=\"container-regular\"><div class=\"navbar-wrapper-2\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"brand w-nav-brand\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7bab0078ec50bf1b32734_logo_125.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-7\"/></a><nav role=\"navigation\" class=\"nav-menu-wrapper-2 w-nav-menu\"><ul role=\"list\" class=\"nav-menu-2 w-list-unstyled\"><li class=\"list-item\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"navbar-link w--current\">Overview</a></li><li class=\"list-item\"><a href=\"/homeowners\" class=\"navbar-link\">Homeowners</a></li><li class=\"list-item\"><a href=\"/business-owners\" class=\"navbar-link\">Business Owners</a></li><li class=\"list-item\"><a href=\"/integrators\" class=\"navbar-link\">Integrators</a></li><li class=\"mobile-margin-top-11\"><div class=\"nav-button-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://app.ovrc.com/#/login\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button w-button\">Log In</a></div></li></ul></nav><div class=\"menu-button-2 w-nav-button\"><div class=\"w-icon-nav-menu\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container\"><div class=\"overhang-div\"><div class=\"hero-image-div\"><h1 class=\"hero-heading\">Peace of Mind for Professionals and Their Clients</h1><p class=\"paragraph-8\">OvrC (oversee) is a revolutionary support platform for professionals that allows them to remotely manage, configure, and troubleshoot devices on the network. From basic home theaters to large-scale networking infrastructures, OvrC empowers pros to keep everything running smoothly.<br/></p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2-p-1600.png 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2-p-2000.png 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2-p-2600.png 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2-p-3200.png 3200w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67b7ed3d39fc3c750e8586fa_Overview_v2.png 4000w\" alt=\"\" class=\"devices-image\"/></div></div><div id=\"Scroll-to-Top-Appear\" class=\"proactive-support-div\"><div class=\"proactive-support-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcceec82e6934ba83c8d42_img_ProactiveSupporticon.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"54\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-3\"/></div><div class=\"div-block-19\"><h2 id=\"w-node-_6c901b60-ebde-d014-0258-64acfb16e09f-d53529ed\" class=\"blue-heading-2\">Proactive Support</h2><p class=\"grey-body-paragraph\">The network is always a priority, and now pros can keep an eye out for slow internet speeds or malfunctioning devices. Usually, they’ll solve issues before clients even notice there’s a problem.</p></div><div class=\"div-block-12\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bccf0813d5e9a1e0006631_Proactive_Support.png\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bccf0813d5e9a1e0006631_Proactive_Support-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bccf0813d5e9a1e0006631_Proactive_Support-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bccf0813d5e9a1e0006631_Proactive_Support-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bccf0813d5e9a1e0006631_Proactive_Support.png 1182w\" alt=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"remote-service-div\"><div class=\"div-block-18\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcd8cff489ba25cf4cf30b_OvrC-website-overview-Fast-Discreet-Remote-Service.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"496\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 496px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcd8cff489ba25cf4cf30b_OvrC-website-overview-Fast-Discreet-Remote-Service-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcd8cff489ba25cf4cf30b_OvrC-website-overview-Fast-Discreet-Remote-Service-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcd8cff489ba25cf4cf30b_OvrC-website-overview-Fast-Discreet-Remote-Service-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcd8cff489ba25cf4cf30b_OvrC-website-overview-Fast-Discreet-Remote-Service.png 1182w\" class=\"image-4\"/></div><div id=\"w-node-_1a3e5db0-f15e-4f31-2f87-e177c165e569-d53529ed\" class=\"div-block-14\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcd8d8eb4efa4daafa6e5e_img_FDSicon.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"55\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"div-block-13\"><div class=\"remote-service-paragraph-div\"><h2 class=\"blue-heading-2\">Fast, Discreet Remote Service</h2><p class=\"grey-body-paragraph\">Glitches happen. If a system starts exhibiting problems, pros can troubleshoot offline devices and solve issues quickly.<br/></p></div></div></div><div class=\"personalized-app-div\"><div id=\"w-node-_434a6a65-5627-130a-be97-e72fe807ddd4-d53529ed\" class=\"div-block-16\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcdc68bc06260494842039_img_PMAicon_mobile.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"55\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"div-block-15\"><div class=\"div-block-17\"><h2 class=\"blue-heading-2\">Personalized Mobile App</h2><p class=\"grey-body-paragraph\">Through a customer mobile app configured by their pro, clients have the option to fix common issues and manage the network at their own convenience.<br/></p></div></div><div class=\"div-block-20\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcdc708760cdc1a76b9b4d_OvrC-website-overview-Personalized-Mobile-App.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"446\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 446px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcdc708760cdc1a76b9b4d_OvrC-website-overview-Personalized-Mobile-App-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcdc708760cdc1a76b9b4d_OvrC-website-overview-Personalized-Mobile-App-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bcdc708760cdc1a76b9b4d_OvrC-website-overview-Personalized-Mobile-App.png 938w\" class=\"image-5\"/></div></div><div class=\"updates-div\"><div class=\"updates-icon-div\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bce393f6a32dbcf6771b75_img_RFUicon.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"55\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-6\"/></div><div class=\"updates-paragraph-div\"><h2 class=\"blue-heading-2\">Remote Firmware Updates</h2><p class=\"paragraph-10\">OvrC notifies pros when the newest software updates are available, so they can solve problems and upgrade devices remotely.<br/></p></div></div><div class=\"trusted-pros-div\"><div class=\"trusted-pros-content\"><h2 class=\"heading-3\">Trusted by Pros</h2><p class=\"paragraph-3\">Pros worldwide rely on OvrC to keep their clients’ devices up and running.<br/></p></div><div class=\"trusted-pros-icons-div\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bce9238b9be688c59d0711_OvrC-website-overview-Trusted-by-Pros-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" alt=\"\" class=\"_500k-locations-image\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bce9298aa65344b2b2ebd4_OvrC-website-overview-Trusted-by-Pros-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" alt=\"\" class=\"new-location-image\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/67bce92eade6cb8a864844f2_OvrC-website-overview-Trusted-by-Pros-3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" alt=\"\" class=\"_22k-dealers-image\"/></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--footer--variant=\"base\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer footer-container w-container\"><div class=\"footer-links-div\"><div class=\"div-block-29\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"left-footer-links w--current\">Overview</a><a href=\"/homeowners\" class=\"left-footer-links\">Homeowners</a><a href=\"/business-owners\" class=\"left-footer-links\">Business Owners</a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"left-footer-links\">Contact</a><a id=\"ot-sdk-show-settings\" href=\"#\" class=\"left-footer-links ot-sdk-show-settings\">Cookie Settings</a></div><div><h3 class=\"footer-header\">Contact Us</h3><p class=\"right-footer-links\"><a href=\"mailto:techsupport@ovrc.com\" class=\"footer-link\">techsupport@ovrc.com</a>‍<br/>‍<strong class=\"footer-phone-number\">1-866-424-4489</strong></p></div></div><div class=\"copyright-div\"><p class=\"copyright-paragraph\">© 2026 ADI Global - All Rights Reserved<br/>Designated trademarks are the property of their respective owners. Use of this website implies acceptance of ADI&#x27;s Website <a href=\"https://www.adiglobal.com/legal/website-terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"footer-link\">Terms of Use </a>and <a href=\"https://www.adiglobal.com/privacy/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"footer-link\">Privacy Policy.</a></p></div></div></section><script src=\"https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/js/ovrc-website.schunk.47d6c6fda17ce6cd.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha384-Lir0RD5ekpd2MnGnYAQgABmR5JLlqnk+1yuFajhbYJ1UEeYeLoiw4y8/3V7XPtBu\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a0ec082bf71c81d53529e3/js/ovrc-website.a9ba356d.d2f30196489a2709.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha384-csGkhjFGgkSz8t16Ud75ydCbjLPF/KwVXVDchd4zvLDKt8Bf0NTemUS5BXjXjjmC\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script></body></html>",
